      </p>

      <div class="ed-body prose prose-lg">
        <p class="ed-lead">
          This page is about the sourcing side of buying secondhand: where used treadmills turn up,
          how each source compares, how to collect safely and move the machine home, what a fair
          price looks like, and the scams that follow this market around. It deliberately does not
          repeat the inspection — our used treadmill buying checklist covers that step by step, and
          you should run it on any machine before money changes hands.
        </p>

        <aside class="ed-note not-prose">
          <span class="ed-note-k">What we checked</span>
          <strong class="text-gray-900">On the figures below.</strong> Secondhand prices vary a great
